<title>USA: Anadigics sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Anadigics sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>WARREN, N.J. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anadigics Inc said it declared a three-for-two stock split of its common stock in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The new shares will be distributed on February 20, 1997 to stockholders of record at the close of business on February 10, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>The company will have 13,121,558 shares outstanding after the split.  It had 8,747,705 before the split.</p>
<p>The company makes circuits to transmit and receive radio and microwave frequency signals.</p>
</text>
